{
  "_comment": [
    "Standard x402 (v2 and v1) and MPP on priced @http endpoints (webagents",
    "gap-closure plan 2.6, 2026-09-26). Read by",
    "typescript/tests/unit/skills/payments/paywall-x402-w2pay.test.ts,",
    "typescript/tests/unit/skills/payments/paywall-mpp-w2pay.test.ts,",
    "python/tests/test_paywall_x402_w2pay.py and python/tests/test_paywall_mpp_w2pay.py,",
    "so the header names, the scheme names, the CORS lists and the spec pack's",
    "section 1.10 and 2.7 conformance vectors are the same in both SDKs.",
    "",
    "The x402 base64 vectors are standard base64 WITH padding over the JSON",
    "text exactly as `x402_vectors.*.json` prints it (key order included);",
    "PAYMENT-SIGNATURE is 1088 characters, the length the reference transport",
    "document quotes for its own vector. The EIP-3009 signature is",
    "illustrative. The MPP ids are the spec pack's recomputed vectors: HMAC",
    "over the CURRENT slot order, `realm|method|intent|request|expires|digest|",
    "opaque`, the header slot appended only when present."
  ],
