      "_binding_comment": [
        "S-297 (2026-09-26): a nonce the paywall mints is BOUND to the request the 402",
        "answered. The binding is `METHOD|path|query|sha256(body)` (the query without",
        "its `?`, empty when there is none; the digest in lowercase hex, the empty",
        "body's for GET and HEAD), and it rides as a FIFTH `|`-part of the HMAC message,",
        "`resource|amount|uuid|expires|binding`. The four-part message above is the",
        "unbound form and its vectors still hold. `request_binding` is the binding of a",
        "POST to /agents/mini/quote?q=1 with the JSON body `{\"q\":\"how much\"}`."
      ],
      "binding_format": "<METHOD>|<path>|<query without ?>|<sha256 hex of the body>",
